          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP730   SAILS,RAILS &amp; TAILS

found it while enjoying the mega.  There was a group of us and we stumbled on it quite by accident.

Only took a picture of the cap and the number shows abit so I won't post it.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
